OL,3,CWoman charged after four men stabbed
OL,4,Cin Covent Garden
OL,6,FA woman has been charged after four
OL,7,Fmen were injured in a stabbing attack
OL,8,Fin central London.
OL,10,FOfficers were called at around 12.30pm
OL,11,Fon Wednesday to reports of a stabbing
OL,12,Fon Endell Street in Covent Garden, a
OL,13,Fbusy tourist area filled with bars,
OL,14,Ftheatres and restaurants.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/2
