OL,3,CWoman charged after four men stabbed
OL,4,Cin Covent Garden
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police said Stella
OL,7,FGollovena, 47, of no fixed address,
OL,8,Fwas charged on Thursday with four
OL,9,Fcounts of wounding with intent to
OL,10,Fcause grievous bodily harm and one
OL,11,Fcount of possession of an offensive
OL,12,Fweapon in a public place.
OL,14,FShe has been remanded in custody to
OL,15,Fappear at Highbury Corner Magistrates'
OL,16,FCourt later on Thursday.
